<title>USA: Patriot American to acquire hotels.</title>
<headline>Patriot American to acquire hotels.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Patriot American Hospitality Inc said on Thrusday that it has contracts to purchase five hotels for a total of $104.5 million.</p>
<p>Patriot said that the hotels have a total of 1,593 rooms and include the Hotel Luxeford Suites and Sheraton Park Place Hotel in Minneapolis; the Hyatt Regency in Tampa, Florida and the Holiday Inn and Ramada Inn at San Francisco's International Airport.</p>
</text>
